{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431380/extras/afae47af5b389a6caa18b559847b7be7.avif?t=1771698205\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431380/extras_big/afae47af5b389a6caa18b559847b7be7.avif?t=1771698205 width=800 height=124 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear of Reptiles is a Dinosaur Horror game that brings dinosaurs into our world. Experience being hunted by dinosaurs that will hunt you down by using multiple senses like sight, hearing, and smell. No where is safe as the longer you stick around, the more likely it will find you, so complete your mission quickly, and <strong><i><u>GET OUT.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dense fog covers the night, reducing your vision and allowing these creatures to see you, before you see them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When prehistoric predators return to our world, your mission is to <strong><i>survive</i></strong>. In this  stealth horror experience, you\u2019ll navigate a world overrun by ruthless dinosaurs, desperate to find shelter in emergency bunkers. In order to survive, you must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Stay Quiet</u></i></strong>\u00a0and don't make a sound as creatures lurking in the night can hear you and will hunt you down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Outsmart</u></i></strong> your obstacles by causing distractions to form new paths Use objects you can find like rocks to throw, or tools to tear open spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Hide</u></i></strong> when they get too close, like old toilets or tuck under small spaces, and hope they don't find you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431380/extras/8f48eeaaee66227959c95910d49a7875.poster.avif?t=1771698205\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431380/extras/8f48eeaaee66227959c95910d49a7875.webm?t=1771698205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431380/extras/8f48eeaaee66227959c95910d49a7875.mp4?t=1771698205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your power supply to navigate your way through different environments, each with their own challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431380/extras/8c3fa163f4c27cea31cec988739c7ebd.poster.avif?t=1771698205\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431380/extras/8c3fa163f4c27cea31cec988739c7ebd.webm?t=1771698205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431380/extras/8c3fa163f4c27cea31cec988739c7ebd.mp4?t=1771698205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly Dinosaurs that will chase you down, with no mercy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Includes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stalker AI that hunts you down using multiple senses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person Stealth limiting your vision, so you have to use your other senses to escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microphone Detection that simulates you having to be quiet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power Puzzle Management used to navigate through unique environments</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2431380?t=1771698205","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2431380?t=1771698205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431380/c0400e02aba09de6f20ba3ff9c61436b983c8bcf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771698205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431380/c0400e02aba09de6f20ba3ff9c61436b983c8bcf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771698205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Some scenes may be described or depicted with blood"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431380/extras/afae47af5b389a6caa18b559847b7be7.avif?t=1771698205\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431380/extras_big/afae47af5b389a6caa18b559847b7be7.avif?t=1771698205 width=800 height=124 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear of Reptiles is a Dinosaur Horror game that brings dinosaurs into our world. Experience being hunted by dinosaurs that will hunt you down by using multiple senses like sight, hearing, and smell. No where is safe as the longer you stick around, the more likely it will find you, so complete your mission quickly, and <strong><i><u>GET OUT.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dense fog covers the night, reducing your vision and allowing these creatures to see you, before you see them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When prehistor